From: Yazan Shhady <yazan.shhady@solid-run.com>
Subject: [PATCH] board: imx8mp_solidrun: include image.h for fit_image_get_data

preload_fdt.c calls fit_image_get_data() without declaring it. GCC 14
rejects implicit function declarations outright, so the build fails:

  preload_fdt.c:54:23: error: implicit declaration of function
  'fit_image_get_data' [-Wimplicit-function-declaration]

Older compilers only warned, which is why this goes unnoticed in the
vendor BSP. Include <image.h>, where the function is declared.

--- a/board/solidrun/imx8mp_solidrun/preload_fdt.c
+++ b/board/solidrun/imx8mp_solidrun/preload_fdt.c
@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@
 #include <binman.h>
 #include <dm/ofnode.h>
 #include <env.h>
+#include <image.h>
 #include <linux/libfdt.h>

 #define OS_DTBS_STAGE_ADDR	RAMDISK_ADDR_R	/* imx-mkimage loads fit image here */
